 collection.","text":"• This issue included an exclusive Panini figurine of Gareon as part of the launch of the second wave of the miniatures collection."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery>\nFile:The Headless Horseman cover.jpg|Full cover artwork\nFile:Gareon Toy.jpg|The exclusive [[Gareon]] figure included with this issue\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Comics| 07]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","text":"Image caption: Full cover artwork\n\nImage caption: The exclusive Gareon figure included with this issue"}],"full_text":"The Headless Horseman is the seventh issue of the Huntik Magazine comic book series, set in the renowned Sleepy Hollow.\n\nSynopsis\n\nThe Huntik team must discover who is wreaking havoc in Sleepy Hollow, New York State. An unknown Seeker is using the Headless Hessian Titan in front of ordinary people, and dozens have been attacked. To keep the Seeker world a secret, not even the Organization acts so carelessly....\n\nTrivia\n\n• This issue included an exclusive Panini figurine of Gareon as part of the launch of the second wave of the miniatures collection.\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Full cover artwork\n\nImage caption: The exclusive Gareon figure included with this issue","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox comic\n|image = File:HM07 The Headless Horseman.jpeg\n| issue         = 07\n| previous      = [[The Titan's Island]]\n| next          = [[The Curse of Venice]]\n| writer = [[Sean Molyneaux]]<br>[[Giorgio Salati]]\n| released = October 2009\n| italian = Il cavaliere senza testa \n| locations     = [[Sleepy Hollow]]\n| new characters = [[Geoffrey Crayon]]\n| new titans    = [[Headless Hessian]]\n}}'''The''' '''Headless Horseman''' is the seventh issue of the ''[[Huntik Magazine]]'' comic book series, set in the renowned Sleepy Hollow.\n\n== Synopsis ==\nThe Huntik team must discover who is wreaking havoc in Sleepy Hollow, New York State. An unknown [[Seeker]] is using the [[Headless Hessian]] Titan in front of ordinary people, and dozens have been attacked. To keep the [[Seeker]] world a secret, not even [[the Organization]] acts so carelessly....\n\n== Trivia ==\n*This issue included an exclusive [[Panini]] figurine of [[Gareon]] as part of the launch of the second wave of the miniatures collection.\n\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery>\nFile:The Headless Horseman cover.jpg|Full cover artwork\nFile:Gareon Toy.jpg|The exclusive [[Gareon]] figure included with this issue\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Comics| 07]]{{Clear}}{{ComicsNav}}","categories":["Comics"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:12930","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Titan's Island","label":"The Titan's Island","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Titan%27s_Island","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12930"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:12934","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Curse of Venice","label":"The Curse of Venice","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Curse_of_Venice","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12934"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:25991","status":"resolved","target_title":"Sean Molyneaux","label":"Sean Molyneaux","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sean_Molyneaux","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A25991"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:26112","status":"resolved","target_title":"Giorgio Salati","label":"Giorgio Salati","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Giorgio_Salati","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A26112"},{"target_title":"Sleepy Hollow","label":"Sleepy Hollow","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sleepy_Hollow","status":"unresolved"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:27642","status":"resolved","target_title":"Geoffrey Crayon","label":"Geoffrey Crayon","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Geoffrey_Crayon","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A27642"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:12932","status":"resolved","target_title":"Headless Hessian","label":"Headless Hessian","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Headless_Hessian","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12932"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1